      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>International Education Management Group, Inc. (IEM) is a US-based company dedicated to promoting global education by entering into lasting partnerships with internationally focused academic institutions. Through these strategic partnerships and collaboration, IEM provides students with access to different sectors of education from four-year high school to graduate degree programs.IEMs collaboration with partner institutions goes beyond student recruitment. Our partnership structure also includes comprehensive enrollment and on-campus support services to address the educational, social and cultural needs of newly admitted international students.At IEM, we believe that our success is defined by the success of our partner institutions and students. Our support, commitment and passion for this shared success is at the heart of our mission.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
